## Why This Is Asked
Evaluates building a robust, real-time data pipeline with correctness, security, and testing considerations in GCP.

## Key Concepts
- Streaming pipelines, deduplication, and windowing
- Data enrichment and PII redaction
- TTL cleanup and partitioned sinks

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo-DoFn for deduplication
function DedupFn(event) {
  if (seen(event.event_id)) return null;
  mark_seen(event.event_id);
  return event;
}
```

